{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0000", "text": "जब मैं तुम्हारी उम्र का था तब प्लूटो ग्रह था।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0001", "text": "वह आवाज़ जाना-पहचाना लगता है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0002", "text": "इन्सान का शरीर एक तरह की मशीन होती है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0003", "text": "यह स्थान मुझे बेहद भयानक लगता है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0004", "text": "जहाँ तक कि मुझे पता है, उसने अभी तक शादी नहीं की है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0005", "text": "क्या यास्मिन अभी भी जर्मनी में रहती है?", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0006", "text": "मुझे पता है कि अगला सवाल क्या होगा।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0007", "text": "मुझे मालूम है कि अगला सवाल क्या होगा।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0008", "text": "तूने मुझसे ज़्यादा क़ीमत ली है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0009", "text": "उठो और चलो।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0010", "text": "उठ जाओ और चलो।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0011", "text": "वापस आना और मुझे बाद में ले लो।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0012", "text": "टॉम घर वापस शिफ़्ट हो रहा है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0013", "text": "टॉम घर वापस जा रहा है रहने के लिए।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0014", "text": "बहुत जल्दी हो जाएगा।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0015", "text": "क्या हमें ख़ास इजाज़त की ज़रूरत है?", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0016", "text": "क्या हमें विशेष अनुमति चाहिए?", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0017", "text": "क्या हमें विशेष अनुमति की आवश्यकता है?", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0018", "text": "मुझे लगता है कि मैरी के लिए ज़्यादा होगा।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-hi-0019", "text": "मुझे लगता है कि मैरी के बस के बाहर है।", "lang": "hi", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://tatoeba.org/"}
